  <!-- EN: psicoin miners in hard mode -->
  <HardPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_hard_mode-0.label>Mineurs de psicoin en mode difficile</HardPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_hard_mode-0.label>
  <!-- EN: One of ours is lying there just like a vegetable, mining those chips. But they are still alive. -->
  <HardPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_hard_mode-0.description>L'un des nôtres est allongé là, comme un légume, en train d'extraire ces chips. Mais ils sont toujours vivants.</HardPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_hard_mode-0.description>
  <HardPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_hard_mode-1.label>Mineurs de psicoin en mode difficile</HardPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_hard_mode-1.label>
  <!-- EN: Two of us are nothing but motionless money generators. Maybe we should turn off the hard mode? -->
  <HardPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_hard_mode-1.description>Deux d'entre nous ne sont rien d'autre que des générateurs d'argent immobiles. Peut-être devrions-nous désactiver le mode difficile ?</HardPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_hard_mode-1.description>
  <HardPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_hard_mode-2.label>Mineurs de psicoin en mode difficile</HardPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_hard_mode-2.label>
  <!-- EN: Bodies with saliva dribbling from their mouths and that cursed miner in their heads. A human farm, this is what it is. -->
  <HardPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_hard_mode-2.description>Des corps avec de la salive qui coule de leur bouche et ce maudit mineur dans la tête. Une ferme humaine, voilà ce que c'est.</HardPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_hard_mode-2.description>
  <!-- EN: psicoin miners in light mode -->
  <LightPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_light_mode-0.label>Mineurs de psicoin en mode léger</LightPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_light_mode-0.label>
  <!-- EN: We are using one of ours to mine those chips. Everything for the colony, I guess... -->
  <LightPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_light_mode-0.description>Nous utilisons l'un des nôtres pour extraire ces puces. Tout pour la colonie, je suppose...</LightPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_light_mode-0.description>
  <LightPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_light_mode-1.label>Mineurs de psicoin en mode léger</LightPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_light_mode-1.label>
  <!-- EN: Two of us have a psicoin miner installed and running in light mode. I wonder how they feel. -->
  <LightPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_light_mode-1.description>Deux d'entre nous ont un mineur de psicoin installé et fonctionnant en mode léger. Je me demande ce qu'ils ressentent.</LightPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_light_mode-1.description>
  <LightPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_light_mode-2.label>Mineurs de psicoin en mode léger</LightPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_light_mode-2.label>
  <!-- EN: Three of us are used to mine psicoins in light mode. Do those chips really worth it? -->
  <LightPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_light_mode-2.description>Trois d'entre nous ont l'habitude de miner des psicoins en mode léger. Ces jetons valent-ils vraiment le coup ?</LightPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_light_mode-2.description>
  <LightPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_light_mode-3.label>Mineurs de psicoin en mode léger</LightPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_light_mode-3.label>
  <!-- EN: They are stumbling, mumbling something and have empty looks. Now I'm really worried. -->
  <LightPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_light_mode-3.description>Ils trébuchent, marmonnent quelque chose et ont des regards vides. Maintenant, je suis vraiment inquiet.</LightPsiCoinMiningInColonyThought.stages.psicoin_miners_in_light_mode-3.description>
  <!-- EN: light psicoin mining -->
  <PsiCoinMiningThought.stages.light_psicoin_mining.label>minage de psicoins légers</PsiCoinMiningThought.stages.light_psicoin_mining.label>
  <!-- EN: This damn implant messes up with my head, it feels as if.. wait, what was I thinking about? -->
  <PsiCoinMiningThought.stages.light_psicoin_mining.description>Ce foutu implant me prend la tête, j'ai l'impression que... attendez, à quoi je pensais ?</PsiCoinMiningThought.stages.light_psicoin_mining.description>
  <!-- EN: hard psicoin mining -->
  <PsiCoinMiningThought.stages.hard_psicoin_mining.label>minage de psicoins durs</PsiCoinMiningThought.stages.hard_psicoin_mining.label>
  <!-- EN: ..due to PLEASE undetermined MAKE our homeland IT to live is to STOP optimal way of... -->
  <PsiCoinMiningThought.stages.hard_psicoin_mining.description>... en raison de la volonté indéterminée de faire de notre patrie un lieu de vie, c'est de cesser d'être le mode de vie optimal...</PsiCoinMiningThought.stages.hard_psicoin_mining.description>
